Grape
=====

Grape is a modified version of Silicate:
https://git.puppy.lgbt/silicate/silicate

The preserved source is based on Silicate v1.0.0-alpha.87, commit
9b5bcfcc6c23b6c4a0e3f7562fd9bd4bfbb2e715 (2026-06-30). The Grape fork's
first preserved commit is 05d26958d6deb8e1b5240824cb49cbc26cd089fe
(2026-07-14).

Silicate identifies peony as its original developer. Silicate, Grape, and the
vendored slc replay code are distributed under GNU GPL version 3. Copyright
remains with their respective contributors. See LICENSE.

